?! The scar on his chest is from when he pulled out the Heavenly Jewel that served as his heart during the demon war 100 years ago."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mink"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72669"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1b2e3b3e23203cb1e86ee410d9621336b2157f46c4ce4a0526f81300edb6aa67.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5a/5af36e2f30402c34be27109cce0f81ac8f44906d74b395b0232eef2b27c40aef.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72670","characterName":"ジュリシス・アルテミス・ル・ティバーニ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72670"},"originalCharacterName":"ジュリシス・アルテミス・ル・ティバーニ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A kindhearted girl who asked for the salvation of the Earthly Realm at a meeting of the Elyos, but was denied permission and so decided to stand up on her own. She is pure of heart who exudes elegance and dignity. However, she is a bit of an oddball among the Elyos...She considers her mission to be a duty imposed upon her, and attempts to carry out the mission without any regrets. She also believes that others should act out of a sense of duty, so she cannot hide her confusion at Anduke's selfish behavior."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mink"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72670"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/47/475987c9c695b84e6c82bec9dde526e57ae1f894dd23bbaad75e775d945bbf62.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0f8eb9229cb102a5211dce0f514aa3e8922d1718f6db9c71ff0fdff45dc97d8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72671","characterName":"ルナティクス・ヴィッシュ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72671"},"originalCharacterName":"ルナティクス・ヴィッシュ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The princess of the country of Luna, whose kingdom was destroyed by King Bria, who was turned into a demon by Princess Sara. She was originally engaged to Bria, but her kingdom was destroyed by King Bria, causing her to lose faith in humanity. She has the ability to read people's minds, and is skilled in both sword and magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mink"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72671"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/17/17b70298e85a5c0560c357ee58177a12c60f2e90f71cd6e0be02c7f96771dfd0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7fab8577658c726f4b0b5d3d4b547d3bc650a629fa2e36c4b60d17ba64c8a55c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72672","characterName":"ペンテシレイヤ・サンドラ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72672"},"originalCharacterName":"ペンテシレイヤ・サンドラ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was raised as a pirate for as long as she could remember, and is a one-eyed swordswoman who travels the world's oceans as the Captain of the Poseidon Pirates. She has the telepathic ability to move objects without using her hands, and combines that power with her giant sword."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mink"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72672"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3209b28187ef6c1a2d6e792b732344b32d1e1523dea6fea54c8e762d16b1644.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d0/d0db721887b9dee769a2c44ca7a1b78b2081ac2a8a251175078af10c6a316967.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72673","characterName":"ミーナ・シルバ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72673"},"originalCharacterName":"ミーナ・シルバ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A dancer with light movements and a pretty face, she has made a living by preforming sensual dances. She fell in love with Anduke's strength and clings to him as they travel together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Mink"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c72673"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4ac69235fa49a5e54c64bfc389e7c4aaea45a93c077340df41cedf35e6d58cec.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e360ae21a05c1a167c2a68852fcf78d8562ca598906ea620f58fbd6c0d5d852.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"川原 栞","creatorId":"vndb:s16169","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s16169","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s16169","name":"川原 栞","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:17641","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c72674","characterName":"リン・ネム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c72674"},"originalCharacterName"